SOAPBOX: Amazing conds the last few hours. 15/20 m were wide open to EU bringing lots of 6/7 pointers for an unexpected finish. With three beams per band (40-10) m and the possibility to run two as a stack those bands kept me busy. 80 m was a total miss here. Not even my 4 square was enough. The noise level on the low bands is likely much higher for most.
SOAPBOX: I like the distance-based points as this gives us down under a chance to be competitive.
SOAPBOX: 73 Holger
SOAPBOX: 73 Holger
